--- !u!114 &1011590811
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1011590808}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b65daeb1756a73e4e9d41661d971a3b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableMemo
  Memos:
  - standardSubject: Employee Onboarding
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Athanor/n\nDay: 1 of 3/n\nObjective: Create Artificial
      Magnetosphere\n\nWelcome to the Habitable Planet Coalition (HPC). You\u2019ve
      arrived at Planet Athanor of the Clockwork Multiplanetary system. This planet
      is the first of three in this system that have contracted with the HPC. By
      leveraging our industry leading manufacturing and replication technology, the
      HPC is able to produce the massive drone lines needed to implement planetary
      engineering interventions. The Workplace Door will unlock when the camera registers
      you drinking your morning coffee. Be sure to finish your work before Five O\u2019Clock!\n"
    altSubject: Employee Onboarding
    altMemo: "Let\u2019s try this one more time, from the top. Welcome to the Habitable
      Planet Coalition (HPC). You\u2019ve arrived at Planet Athanor of the Clockwork
      Multiplanetary System. Oh who\u2019re we kidding? We\u2019ve done this again
      and again but the memory wipe isn\u2019t working like it used to, is it? You
      think you know what to do, but remember, you\u2019re here for one job and one
      job only. Build what the HPC tells you to build. Make different choices this
      time around, won\u2019t you?"
  - standardSubject: First Day Feedback
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Athanor\nDay: 2 of 3\nObjective: Outer Core Convection
      Short-Term Solution\n\nCongratulations on your successful implementation of
      the Plasma Torus (Pro)\u2122. Planet Athanor\u2019s atmosphere is now shielded
      from harmful solar radiation. Please be mindful that all communication with
      planet-side contacts should be synergized and channeled through the competent
      hands of our management team. Unauthorized contact will severely impact your
      Employee Efficiency Score and may lead to disastrous outcomes for Build implementation.\n"
    altSubject: First Day Feedback
    altMemo: "\nPlanet: Athanor\nDay: 2 of 3\nObjective: Outer Core Convection Short-Term
      Solution\n\nCongratulations on your successful implementation of the Plasma
      Torus (Pro)\u2122. Planet Athanor\u2019s atmosphere is now shielded from harmful
      solar radiation. Please be mindful that all communication with planet-side
      contacts should be synergized and channeled through the competent hands of
      our management team. Unauthorized contact will severely impact your Employee
      Efficiency Score and may lead to disastrous outcomes for Build implementation.\n"
  - standardSubject: Gold Star!
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Athanor\nDay: 3 of 3\nObjective: Outer Core Convection
      Long-Term Solution\n\nThe Habitable Planet Coalition thanks you for your successful
      implementation of the F.I.S.C.H. drone build. With hard work and innovation
      we Build to Lead Better Lives. P.S. Here\u2019s a tip: your work day doesn\u2019t
      start until you open the In Chute.\n"
    altSubject: Write-Up!
    altMemo: "\nPlanet: Athanor\nDay: 3 of 3\nObjective: Outer Core Convection Long-Term
      Solution\n\nQuality control is of the utmost importance! A higher than acceptable
      rate of manufacturing imperfections were detected during the F.I.S.C.H. rollout.
      Please ensure you are using only HPC Certified parts in your Builds. Failure
      to meet this requirement will significantly reduce your Employee Efficiency
      Score. P.S. Here\u2019s a tip: your work day doesn\u2019t start until you open
      the In Chute.\n"
  - standardSubject: Promotional Transfer Notice
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Melligo\nDay: 1 of 3\nObjective: Planet Cooling Required
      Step 1\n\nAfter your excellent work on Planet Athanor, we are pleased to welcome
      you to Planet Melligo of the Clockwork Multiplanetary System. The dominant
      government of Planet Melligo has contracted with the HPC to address an out
      of control climate change feedback loop. \n"
    altSubject: Lateral Transfer Notice
    altMemo: "\nPlanet: Melligo\nDay: 1 of 3\nObjective: Planet Cooling Required
      Step 1\n\nWelcome to Planet Melligo of the Clockwork Multiplanetary System.
      The dominant government of Planet Melligo has contracted with the HPC to address
      an out of control climate change feedback loop. We hope this new assignment
      helps you re-align your production to HPC standards. \n"
  - standardSubject: Plutonium Star!
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Melligo\nDay: 2 of 3\nObjective: Planet Cooling Required
      Step 2\n\nThank you for your stand-out implementation of the Orbital Starshade
      program. With this project we take our first steps at reducing the temperature
      of Planet Melligo. Remember, a coffee a day keeps the doctor away! Fuel Up!
      \n"
    altSubject: Error Documentation
    altMemo: "\nPlanet: Melligo\nDay: 2 of 3\nObjective: Planet Cooling Required
      Step 2\n\nDiscrepancies have been discovered with the Starshade program implementation.
      Please note that Build Room cameras are monitoring you closely for any behaviors
      that may need adjustment. Consider this your notice to improve or face further
      motivation to align you to HPC standards. \n"
  - standardSubject: Employee Spotlight
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Melligo\nDay: 3 of 3\nObjective: Reduce Carbon In Atmosphere\n\nCorporate
      profits soar with the successful implementation of the Atmospheric Rejuvenator.
      Global cooling is now beyond the two-degree target threshold. Throw yourself
      an imaginary taco party. You\u2019ve earned it. \n"
    altSubject: Formal Reprimand
    altMemo: '

      Planet: Melligo

      Day: 3 of 3

      Objective: Reduce
      Carbon In Atmosphere


      Valued employee, It has come to our attention
      that the Atmospheric Rejuvenator profits have severely underperformed projections.
      We expect you to adhere strictly to HPC standards or face possible demotion.
      In addition, your taco party privileges are being revoked until further notice.

'
  - standardSubject: Promotional Transfer
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Crasis\nDay: 1 of 3\nObjective: Reduce Earthquake Severity\n\nAfter
      your stellar implementation of our Carbon Sink Sower technology, we\u2019re
      promoting you and transferring you to the third planet in this multiplanetary
      system to contract our services. Welcome to Planet Crasis. Settlements on this
      planet are being devastated by megaquakes and eruptions. We\u2019ve assigned
      you to stabilize the seismic activity and remove the harmful volcanic sulfur
      dioxide from the atmosphere. \n"
    altSubject: Demotion Notice and Transfer
    altMemo: "\nPlanet: Crasis\nDay: 1 of 3\nObjective: Reduce Earthquake Severity\n\nWelcome
      to Planet Crasis. Settlements on this planet are being devastated by megaquakes
      and eruptions. We\u2019ve assigned you to stabilize the seismic activity and
      remove the harmful volcanic sulfur dioxide from the atmosphere. It is our hope
      that this transfer will allow you to recommit to the HPC Standard of performance.
      We\u2019ve enabled additional security protocols through our Employee Monitoring
      System. If the system detects non-HPC certified parts in your build today,
      you will be immediately placed into retraining.\n"
  - standardSubject: Oganesson Star!
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Crasis\nDay: 2 of 3\nObjective: Scrub Sulfur Dioxide
      from Stratosphere\n\nThe HPC thanks you for your successful M.O.L.E. Implementation.
      Congratulations on passing your surprise mid-season assessment. It is through
      the hard work of employees like yourself that the HPC is able to preserve the
      habitability of the galaxy. Have a casual Friday next week! \n"
    altSubject: Final WARNING
    altMemo: "\nPlanet: Crasis\nDay: 2 of 3\nObjective: Scrub Sulfur Dioxide from
      Stratosphere\n\nFailed M.O.L.E. Drone Implementation. Final WARNING. Further
      mistakes will not be tolerated. Don\u2019t forget to drink your coffee! It
      is through the hard work of employees like yourself that the HPC is able to
      preserve the habitability of the galaxy.\n"
  - standardSubject: Quark Matter Star!
    standardMemo: "\nPlanet: Crasis\nDay: 3 of 3\nObjective: Slow Mantle Convection\n\nCongratulations
      on your valuable contribution to the Stratospheric Cleanser program. With work
      on the atmosphere progressing as planned, we must pivot our objectives toward
      a long-term solution to fix the overrapid mantle convection. The Habitable
      Planetary Coalition thanks you for your continued excellence. \n"
    altSubject: Economic Downsizing
    altMemo: "\nPlanet: Crasis\nDay: 3 of 3\nObjective: Slow Mantle Convection\n\nDue
      to a malfunction in the Stratospheric Cleanser Model, you are on the edge of
      our company-wide downscaling efficiency measures. With our work on stabilizing
      the atmosphere completed, we must pivot our objectives toward a long-term solution
      to fix the overrapid mantle convection. \n"
