    standardImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fa32f6e8330313d4495dd75eb56b14e2, type: 3}
    altTitle: Advertisement
    altTagline: Buy HPC Brand Coffee
    altPaper: "Try Athanor\u2019s latest drink craze, HPC Brand Coffee! Laced with
      ocular nanorobots, it makes the world a CLEANER, more functional place. Here\u2019s
      a tip, it works on machines too!"
    altImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fa32f6e8330313d4495dd75eb56b14e2, type: 3}
  - standardTitle: FISCH Smells Fishy!
    standardTagline: Melting Criticism for HPC
    standardPaper: "F.I.S.C.H. Drones? Does that stand for \u2018Forsaken Investments
      in Swift Corrosion and overHeating?\u2019Planet Athanor\u2019s economy has
      been flushed down the sewers by HPC partnership."
    standardImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d0f2d9af96373c44fb6cc91e9b7a9680, type: 3}
    altTitle: A Swimming Success
    altTagline: FISCH Overcome Widespread Doubt
    altPaper: "Folks, this isn\u2019t the kind of fish you\u2019re thinking of! These
      are drones that drill all the way down to the planet\u2019s outer core. From
      there the drones swim in formation to push the molten current into a convective
      motion. Don\u2019t try this at home!"
    altImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f9a113503504e64cb4a3c819c90c4be, type: 3}
  - standardTitle: "Shakespeare\u2019s Cafe Corner"
    standardTagline: Downcast Poets Spill their Hearts
    standardPaper: 'Mantle Plume you came too soon

      You shot through my livingroom

      Your
      sulfur skies smell like doom'
    standardImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 050c9b5b97863ca43854e168658c314a, type: 3}
    altTitle: "Shakespeare\u2019s Cafe Corner"
    altTagline: Downcast Poets Spill their Hearts
    altPaper: "Magnetosphere I hold you dear\nConvective core you\u2019re not a bore\nCosmic
      Rays I refute your ways!"
    altImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 93b644d2e4f80cc438fcbf3032ba9689, type: 3}
  - standardTitle: Starshade Stars in Spectacular Failure
    standardTagline: Heatwave Boils Away Hope.
    standardPaper: Sweaty citizens take to the streets to protest against the HPC.
      They want their money back. Dear reader, how do YOU feel about being swindled?
    standardImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2d051ac981721184bba466b40702f0e7, type: 3}
    altTitle: Starshade Soars to Lagrange Point
    altTagline: 'Brrrrr '
    altPaper: "Citizens flock to town squares all across the world to throw sweater
      parties. The Herald did a deep dive on the best styles being rediscovered today.
      Argyle vs Cable-Knit vs Flanel\u2014what best fits your personal brand of retro-funky?"
    altImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b2d9779376d50034a923faf56370aa0e, type: 3}
  - standardTitle: HPC In the Sky With Diamonds
    standardTagline: Winter Sports are Back!
    standardPaper: 'Diamond Dust leads to Black Diamond Slopes. Get those skis ready
      for the slalom or take out your snowboard for the best powder Melligo has seen
      in centuries! '
    standardImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e407d73726bf65d4fb9335f7840250c2, type: 3}
    altTitle: CMS in the Sky With Sulfur
    altTagline: Acid Rain Devastation
    altPaper: 'Fish Die-Offs! The Statue of Awesomeness Turns Green! The Herald wants
      to know who greenlit this collaboration with the HPC that caused this gross
      greenery. '
    altImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 81bfcfcda1c8a51419a7db9cde9cb499, type: 3}
  - standardTitle: Letters to the Editor
    standardTagline: Concerned Citizens Ramble
    standardPaper: "Redwoods? Big deal! My house is built of wood, so I started my
      own carbon sequestration program. See, I bought a REALLY nice shovel at Cheap-Mart,
      and I\u2019m burying it one shovelful at a time. It\u2019s quicker than growing
      a thousand-year-old tree!"
    standardImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3c2fd0869a0249b4091ecb96801ffd30, type: 3}
    altTitle: Letters to the Editor
    altTagline: Concerned Citizens Ramble
    altPaper: "Look, I get that the Macroalgae Carbon Sequestration is removing a
      record amount of carbon from the atmosphere. And that\u2019s good. But it\u2019s
      getting in the way of my hunt for sea monsters! What about the cryptids!?"
    altImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e755fef7c960c80498118685d501302f, type: 3}
  - standardTitle: Superquakes Mollified!
    standardTagline: M.O.L.E. Burrows into our Hearts
    standardPaper: "You can shake, you can rattle, you can roll, but thanks to the
      M.O.L.E. the ground beneath you won\u2019t! Evacuation notices across the planet
      have been paused due to the successful intervention."
    standardImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bfe017dd48c81ef4a82dc3ff2a38bdf9, type: 3}
    altTitle: CMS the CLAMP Scamps!
    altTagline: CLAMP leads to Stagnant Lid Tectonics
    altPaper: Smell the sulfur in the air? See the plumes of lava and ash? What was
      seen by many as a miracle seismic intervention has instead accelerated megaquake
      and volcanic activity.
    altImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d00c098517ab11e43b422845ab8c5e8c, type: 3}
  - standardTitle: "Music Corner With Darwin\u2019s DJ"
    standardTagline: 'Evolve Your Eardrums '
    standardPaper: "Check out this new hit single: \"Drones are Going Down Down\"
      from the pop punk sensation <i>Irradiated Materials Boy.</i> Don\u2019t get
      hit by falling drones!"
    standardImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7212be21bb73e1a4c90931c0a08c3d49, type: 3}
    altTitle: "Music Corner With Darwin\u2019s DJ"
    altTagline: Evolve Your Eardrums
    altPaper: 'Check out this new hit single: "I Write Sunny Skies not Tragicomedies,"
      from the lead singer of <i>Chaos at the Video Game Arcade.</i> Even the emos
      feel joy as sulfuric clouds lift!'
    altImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2150d7e16ecd4b84ea88c3603ac8ef83, type: 3}
  newsPaperName: {fileID: 1843616888995250886}
